[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
SMS Gateway has been installed under:

  %%WWWDIR%%

First-time setup:

  %%WWWDIR%%/hw/FreeBSD/install-huawei-lte.sh --target hilink
  %%WWWDIR%%/config/set_token.sh

Review %%WWWDIR%%/config/local.php before testing authenticated endpoints.
The token helper stores only the token's SHA-256 hash; save the generated token.

The package creates missing config, database, and log directories, enables
sms_gateway after successful hardware setup, starts the cache sync poller on
boot, and installs log rotation policy at:

  /usr/local/etc/newsyslog.conf.d/sms-gateway.conf

Useful commands:

  service sms_gateway status
  service sms_gateway logrotate

If the APACHE option was enabled, check and reload Apache after configuration:

  apachectl configtest
  service apache24 reload
EOM
}
]
